### Ejecuta authLogin una vez en este archivo para obtener un token sin copiarlo.
@accessToken = {{authLogin.response.body.$.access_token}}

# @name authLogin
POST {{apiUrl}}/api/sesion/login
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "identifier": "diego deluque",
  "password": "Contrasena123#"
}

### Crear empresa
POST http://localhost:4000/api/empresas HTTP/1.1
Authorization: Bearer {{accessToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "tax_id": "900123454-1",
  "legal_name": "TransMovil S.A.S",
  "primary_contact": "Juan Perez",
  "status": "active"
}

###

### Crear empresa con tax_id duplicado (409)
POST http://localhost:4000/api/empresas HTTP/1.1
Authorization: Bearer {{accessToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "tax_id": "900123456-1",
  "legal_name": "Otra Empresa Ltda",
  "status": "active"
}
